      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42387",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nO, let me clip you\nIn arms as sound as when I wooed, in heart\nAs merry as when our nuptial day was done\nAnd tapers burned to bedward!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42387/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42387/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 27,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42387/line-3",
          "start": 28,
          "end": 70,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42387/line-4",
          "start": 71,
          "end": 112,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42387/line-5",
          "start": 113,
          "end": 142,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 862099,
        "end": 862286,
        "line": 32522,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@42387",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42578",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nFlower of warriors, how is’t with Titus Lartius?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42578/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42578/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 862290,
        "end": 862378,
        "line": 32530,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@42578",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nAs with a man busied about decrees,\nCondemning some to death and some to exile;\nRansoming him or pitying, threat’ning the other;\nHolding Corioles in the name of Rome\nEven like a fawning greyhound in the leash,\nTo let him slip at will.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-4",
          "start": 89,
          "end": 137,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-5",
          "start": 138,
          "end": 174,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-6",
          "start": 175,
          "end": 218,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42670/line-7",
          "start": 219,
          "end": 243,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 862382,
        "end": 862680,
        "line": 32535,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@42670",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42972",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nWhere is that slave\nWhich told me they had beat you to your trenches?\nWhere’s he? Call him hither.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42972/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42972/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42972/line-3",
          "start": 30,
          "end": 79,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@42972/line-4",
          "start": 80,
          "end": 108,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 862684,
        "end": 862832,
        "line": 32545,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@42972",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nLet him alone.\nHe did inform the truth. But for our gentlemen,\nThe common file—a plague! Tribunes for them!—\nThe mouse ne’er shunned the cat as they did budge\nFrom rascals worse than they.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 23,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124/line-3",
          "start": 24,
          "end": 71,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124/line-4",
          "start": 72,
          "end": 117,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124/line-5",
          "start": 118,
          "end": 167,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43124/line-6",
          "start": 168,
          "end": 197,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 862836,
        "end": 863083,
        "line": 32552,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@43124",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43375",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nBut how prevailed you?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43375/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43375/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 32,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 863087,
        "end": 863149,
        "line": 32561,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@43375",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43441",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nWill the time serve to tell? I do not think.\nWhere is the enemy? Are you lords o’ th’ field?\nIf not, why cease you till you are so?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43441/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43441/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43441/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 101,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43441/line-4",
          "start": 102,
          "end": 140,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 863153,
        "end": 863333,
        "line": 32566,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@43441",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43625",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nMartius, we have at disadvantage fought,\nAnd did retire to win our purpose.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43625/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43625/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43625/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 85,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 863337,
        "end": 863457,
        "line": 32573,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@43625",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43749",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nHow lies their battle? Know you on which side\nThey have placed their men of trust?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43749/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43749/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43749/line-3",
          "start": 55,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 863461,
        "end": 863587,
        "line": 32579,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@43749",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43879",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nAs I guess, Martius,\nTheir bands i’ th’ vaward are the Antiates,\nOf their best trust; o’er them Aufidius,\nTheir very heart of hope.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43879/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43879/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 30,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43879/line-3",
          "start": 31,
          "end": 74,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43879/line-4",
          "start": 75,
          "end": 115,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@43879/line-5",
          "start": 116,
          "end": 141,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 863591,
        "end": 863777,
        "line": 32585,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@43879",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nI do beseech you,\nBy all the battles wherein we have fought,\nBy th’ blood we have shed together, by th’ vows we have made\nTo endure friends, that you directly set me\nAgainst Aufidius and his Antiates,\nAnd that you not delay the present, but,\nFilling the air with swords advanced and darts,\nWe prove this very hour.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 26,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-3",
          "start": 27,
          "end": 69,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-4",
          "start": 70,
          "end": 130,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-5",
          "start": 131,
          "end": 174,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-6",
          "start": 175,
          "end": 209,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-7",
          "start": 210,
          "end": 250,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-8",
          "start": 251,
          "end": 298,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44069/line-9",
          "start": 299,
          "end": 323,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 863781,
        "end": 864169,
        "line": 32593,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@44069",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nThough I could wish\nYou were conducted to a gentle bath\nAnd balms applied to you, yet dare I never\nDeny your asking. Take your choice of those\nThat best can aid your action.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461/line-3",
          "start": 30,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461/line-4",
          "start": 66,
          "end": 108,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461/line-5",
          "start": 109,
          "end": 152,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44461/line-6",
          "start": 153,
          "end": 183,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 864173,
        "end": 864406,
        "line": 32605,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@44461",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COMINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nThose are they\nThat most are willing. If any such be here—\nAs it were sin to doubt—that love this painting\nWherein you see me smeared; if any fear\nLesser his person than an ill report;\nIf any think brave death outweighs bad life,\nAnd that his country’s dearer than himself;\nLet him alone, or so many so minded,\nWave thus to express his disposition\nAnd follow Martius.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 23,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-3",
          "start": 24,
          "end": 67,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-4",
          "start": 68,
          "end": 115,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-5",
          "start": 116,
          "end": 155,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-6",
          "start": 156,
          "end": 193,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.6/p@44698/line-7",
